            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Latest state from the watch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kebenaran diambil dari katalog, bukan dari jawaban engine. Kalau engine salah mengenali, kita tetap tahu objek yang sebenarnya dituju.": {
      "comment": "",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ground truth comes from the catalogue, not from the engine's answer. If the engine misidentifies the object, we still know what was really being pointed at."
